---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy notice (DRAFT) · Learn2Think">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-4 px-4 py-10">
    <p class="rounded-lg bg-warn-soft p-3 font-semibold">DRAFT: placeholder text, to be reviewed by the founder's CA before launch. Not final legal advice.</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">Privacy notice</h1>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-medium">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-2">On the waitlist form: your email address, the role you are aiming for, and whether you are a student or career switcher. Nothing else is asked.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-medium">Why</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-2">To email you once when the first case is ready, and to send a founding-member code. We do not sell your data.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-medium">Analytics and error reports</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-2">We use PostHog for anonymous page and sign-up counts (role and learner type, never your email) and Sentry for error reports. Both may store a small identifier in your browser.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-medium">Your rights</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-2">You can ask us to access, correct or delete your waitlist entry. Contact: [contact email to be added]. Data is stored with Google Firebase (Firestore). [Storage location and retention period to be confirmed.]</p>
    <p><a href="/" class="underline">Back to home</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
